S\",\"description\":\"Add tools to the VoiceOS agent and answer with native cards in the Mac notch.\",\"href\":\"/integrations\"},{\"title\":\"How it works\",\"description\":\"The architecture of a VoiceOS integration, in one page.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/how-it-works\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart\",\"description\":\"Build your first integration in about three minutes — no code, right inside VoiceOS.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/quickstart\"},{\"title\":\"Build with AI\",\"description\":\"The Integration Studio turns a sentence into an installed, working integration.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/build-with-ai\"}]},{\"group\":\"Building blocks\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Build with code\",\"description\":\"Hand-build, verify, and install an integration in about ten minutes.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/build-with-code\"},{\"title\":\"Defining tools\",\"description\":\"Descriptions the agent routes on, schemas it fills, and handlers that behave.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/tools\"},{\"title\":\"Fast intents\",\"description\":\"Give short Agent Mode commands a faster route to your existing tools.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/intents\"},{\"title\":\"Result cards\",\"description\":\"Attach a native glance card to any tool result — the easy way to look great in the notch.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/result-cards\"},{\"title\":\"Confirmation cards\",\"description\":\"Anything that acts gets approved first — declare the card the user approves on.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/confirmations\"},{\"title\":\"Setup fields\",\"description\":\"Ask the user for API keys and options — VoiceOS collects, stores, and injects them.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/setup-fields\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks\",\"description\":\"Tap the voice pipeline — see the transcript before the agent, your tool calls before they run, the finished turn after it lands.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/hooks\"}]},{\"group\":\"Custom widgets\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Custom widgets\",\"description\":\"When blocks aren't enough — your own HTML, sandboxed, with a strict bridge.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/widgets\"},{\"title\":\"Widget Kit\",\"description\":\"The dependency-free design system behind every Studio-built card.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/widget-kit\"},{\"title\":\"Widget confirmations\",\"description\":\"Fully custom confirmation cards — your pixels, VoiceOS's confirm button.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/widget-confirmations\"}]},{\"group\":\"Ship it\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Branding\",\"description\":\"Name, icon, and the mark on every card — make your integration feel official.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/branding\"},{\"title\":\"Testing \u0026 debugging\",\"description\":\"Verify like VoiceOS does — before your users do.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/testing\"},{\"title\":\"Install \u0026 share\",\"description\":\"The folder is the unit — install it, manage it, hand it to anyone.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/distribution\"}]},{\"group\":\"Reference\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Manifest reference\",\"description\":\"Every field of voiceos.integration.json, with the validation rules that apply.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/reference/manifest\"},{\"title\":\"Glance block reference\",\"description\":\"Every result-card block — props, caps, and rendering behavior.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/reference/glance-blocks\"},{\"title\":\"UI block reference\",\"description\":\"Every confirmation-view block — layout, display, inputs, actions, and bindings.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/reference/ui-blocks\"},{\"title\":\"Widget bridge reference\",\"description\":\"The exact postMessage protocol between VoiceOS and a sandboxed widget.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/reference/widget-bridge\"},{\"title\":\"Limits \u0026 stability\",\"description\":\"Every cap in one place, the security model, and the compatibility promise.\",\"href\":\"/integrations/reference/limits\"}]}]}]},\"maps\":{\"firstHrefInVersion\":{},\"firstHrefInLanguage\":{}},\"children\":\"$L45\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"46:I[763509,[\"/mi