`,true);if(!Table)_missingMdxReference(`Table`,true);return _jsxs(_Fragment,{children:[_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`VoiceOS is a voice assistant that lives in the Mac notch. Users talk, the agent\nacts, and answers arrive as `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`cards in the notch`}),`.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`A `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`custom integration`}),` puts your thing on that surface. You declare tools; the\nagent calls them when the user asks; your results render as native cards — or as\n`,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/widgets`,children:`fully custom UI`}),` when you want every pixel. If it has an\nAPI, you can build it: internal dashboards, home automation, your CRM, a coffee\ntracker.`]}),`\n`,_jsx(Frame,{caption:`First-party integrations answering in the notch. A custom integration renders on this exact surface.`,children:_jsx(OptimizedImage,{src:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=4d472003dfdf108cc1f40833ec780c93`,alt:`Two VoiceOS notch cards side by side: a Gmail inbox card listing three emails with a green New badge, and a Google Calendar card listing the day's three events with times.`,\"data-og-width\":`3808`,width:`3808`,\"data-og-height\":`1278`,height:`1278`,\"data-path\":`images/integrations/gallery-official.png`,\"data-optimize\":`true`,\"data-opv\":`3`,srcset:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=280\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=9ea6f07e7683ae143892092171abd303 280w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=560\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=06c8847a9d1185a30462977746bb152c 560w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=840\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=4b79758bfeeb0bf92e60aa8b47984fe9 840w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=1100\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=6b9f43054ea1ebf2d190d89877be13ef 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=1650\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=7c17960c0709e18b36df7a0b5113ba3b 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/gallery-official.png?w=2500\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=9cc1df8f7d9c7dd92dc3d5651b856718 2500w`})}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`Think of it like the App Store: `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`VoiceOS is iOS, your integration is an app.`}),`\nOne manifest declares what it does (tools), where it runs (runtime), what it\nneeds (auth and permissions), and how it confirms actions (declarative UI).\nVoiceOS wires up the rest. You never touch VoiceOS internals — which is also why\nyour code can never reach VoiceOS’s backend or secrets.`]}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`pick-a-path`,children:`Pick a path`}),`\n`,_jsxs(CardGroup,{cols:2,children:[_jsx(Card,{title:`Build with AI — no code`,icon:`sparkles`,href:`/integrations/quickstart`,children:_jsx(_components.p,{children:`Describe your integration in a sentence. The Integration Studio plans it,\nbuilds it, designs its cards, and lets you test-drive it live. ~3 minutes.`})}),_jsx(Card,{title:`Build with code`,icon:`code`,href:`/integrations/build-with-code`,children:_jsx(_components.p,{children:`A standalone folder with a manifest and a small MCP server. Full control\nover logic, cards, and widgets. ~10 minutes.`})})]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`Both produce the same thing: an integration folder VoiceOS can install.\nStudio-built integrations are real folders too — open one in your editor, or\nhand it to a coding agent, and keep building.`}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`what-it-feels-like`,children:`What it feels like`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`Say you built an `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`ElevenLabs`}),` integration.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(Steps,{children:[_jsxs(Step,{title:`The user speaks, and the agent confirms`,children:[_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[_jsx(_components.em,{children:`“Read this in Rachel’s voice”`}),` — the agent picks your `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`generate_speech`}),` tool.\nBecause it `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`acts`}),` (it spends API credits and writes a file), VoiceOS first\nrenders the confirmation card you declared in the manifest, before any of your\ncode runs.`]}),_jsx(Frame,{caption:`The user edits the arguments; the edited values are what your handler receives.`,children:_jsx(OptimizedImage,{src:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=77db66a04aa42d377007f7a78b2b667e`,alt:`A 'Generate speech' confirmation card in the notch with an editable Text field reading 'VoiceOS turns your voice into action.', a Voice picker set to Rachel, and Cancel / Generate buttons.`,\"data-og-width\":`1952`,width:`1952`,\"data-og-height\":`1312`,height:`1312`,\"data-path\":`images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png`,\"data-optimize\":`true`,\"data-opv\":`3`,srcset:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=280\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=171d7e44cf30841190e3f197e846c4f6 280w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=560\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=fccfe7609448cfcdadf6b409bf1c9824 560w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=840\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=924450033305f47d724d9cea89b5995f 840w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=1100\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=90b456949c43ac4da84fc748e721c46a 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=1650\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=5e30b3f61853450a6755fa0915a3130d 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-confirm.png?w=2500\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=04d171dbbac86e888afaf69cde83d49e 2500w`})})]}),_jsxs(Step,{title:`Your server runs, your card appears`,children:[_jsx(_components.p,{children:`The handler calls the ElevenLabs API and returns JSON. The agent narrates the\ndata; the notch shows your card.`}),_jsx(Frame,{caption:`A glance card — rendered by VoiceOS's own components from three lines of JSON.`,children:_jsx(OptimizedImage,{src:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=f003b7bec7ff21f0ca8f1d506e4659d5`,alt:`The VoiceOS notch showing the prompt 'Read this in Rachel's voice' and an ElevenLabs result card: Voice Rachel, Length 0:07, Saved to narration.mp3, with a green 'Opened in Music' badge.`,\"data-og-width\":`1952`,width:`1952`,\"data-og-height\":`1162`,height:`1162`,\"data-path\":`images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png`,\"data-optimize\":`true`,\"data-opv\":`3`,srcset:`https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=280\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=7c59cae9c5c3516ddd04f22815fe16dd 280w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=560\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=06247417cf1e3ec668c931f29381603e 560w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=840\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=c9b0e4f8a4dd0afc17a94d2d6c88dbd9 840w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=1100\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=7dc1b8cb15e5335ef2359db5d04cc35b 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=1650\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=56e4326f6d9c85faf81f37482f73c5de 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/voiceos/KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j/images/integrations/elevenlabs-hero.png?w=2500\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\u0026n=KVsJZgZq4ypscj2j\u0026q=85\u0026s=c07ba04bab026ea4d7c1e9e8676c03ad 2500w`})})]})]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`Read-only tools skip the confirmation entirely — `,_jsx(_components.em,{children:`“what voices do I have?”`}),` just\nanswers, instantly, with a card.`]}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`what-you-can-build`,children:`What you can build`}),`\n`,_jsxs(Table,{children:[_jsx(_components.thead,{children:_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.th,{}),_jsx(_components.th,{})]})}),_jsxs(_components.tbody,{children:[_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Lookups`})}),_jsx(_components.td,{children:`Dashboards, prices, statuses, schedules — anything with an API.`})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Actions`})}),_jsx(_components.td,{children:`Send, create, post, open — always behind a confirmation card.`})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Trackers`})}),_jsx(_components.td,{children:`”Log my coffee”, with stats and charts in the notch.`})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Long-running work`})}),_jsx(_components.td,{children:`Background tasks that chime and show a card when done.`})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Fully custom UI`})}),_jsx(_components.td,{children:`Sandboxed HTML widgets when the built-in blocks aren’t enough.`})]})]})]}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`the-path-through-these-docs`,children:`The path through these docs`}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`Read top to bottom and you’ll go from nothing to a polished, branded\nintegration.`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.ol,{children:[`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/quickstart`,children:`Quickstart`})}),` — build one with AI, in the app,\nin three minutes.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/how-it-works`,children:`How it works`})}),` — the architecture in one page.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/build-with-code`,children:`Build with code`})}),` and\n`,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/tools`,children:`defining tools`})}),` — schemas, handlers, background\nexecution. Add `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/intents`,children:`fast intents`})}),` for quicker\nselection of common commands.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/result-cards`,children:`Result cards`})}),`,\n`,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/confirmations`,children:`confirmations`})}),`,\n`,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations/setup-fields`,children:`setup fields`})}),` — native UI, the easy way.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/integrations